# Pairs with NoConcurrentLeafWrites. A gate released before the reparent write lands lets a checkpoint flush overlap it.
MODULE: SetParentKeepsWrite
TARGET: NoConcurrentLeafWrites
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the reparent write releases the gate without retiring its write
PERTURBS: FinishSetParent

--- FIND
    /\ gate' = "free"
    /\ writes' = writes - 1
    /\ resurrected' = (resurrected \/ cleared)
    /\ seed' = "digestQueued"
--- REPLACE
    /\ gate' = "free"
    \* MUTATION: the write is still in flight
    /\ writes' = writes
    /\ resurrected' = (resurrected \/ cleared)
    /\ seed' = "digestQueued"
--- END
